 <s:String x:Key="autoLoud">4 / 4 · Speak louder; do not shout</s:String>
 <s:String x:Key="autoAmbientPhrase">Do not speak or touch the microphone. Keep everyday background sounds running.</s:String>
 <s:String x:Key="autoReadPhrase">“You can hear my voice clearly now. My quiet words should stay understandable. When I speak during a game, my voice should sound clear and steady.” Repeat at the volume requested for this stage.</s:String>
 <s:String x:Key="secondsRemaining">s remaining</s:String>
