 <s:String x:Key="autoQuietMissing">Not enough softer speech was detected. Speak a little softer without whispering and repeat.</s:String>
 <s:String x:Key="autoLoudMissing">Not enough louder speech was detected. Speak louder without shouting and repeat.</s:String>
 <s:String x:Key="autoStageMismatch">The speech levels do not follow the expected order. Follow the prompts and repeat.</s:String>
 <s:String x:Key="autoGainLimited">Your softer speech needs more than +12 dB to reach the target. The gain limit stays active; try moving a little closer.</s:String>
 <s:String x:Key="autoNoisyWarning">The room level is close to your speech. Tone boosts were limited; check the result with headphones.</s:String>
 <s:String x:Key="autoDynamicsSmall">Your softer and louder speech have similar levels. Your microphone may use automatic gain; consider repeating with different speech levels.</s:String>
